{"id":"183342408987402c","group":"FormalSystem","path":"FormalSystem/622_Prior_时态逻辑.md","title":"622 Prior 时态逻辑","display":"622_Prior_时态逻辑","type":"system","metadata":{},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[],"html":"<p><span class=\"inline-tag\">#FormalSystem</span></p>\n\n<h1 id=\"1.-符号表\">1. 符号表</h1>\n<p>令</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathbb N=\\{0,1,2,\\ldots\\},\\qquad\n\\mathcal P_{\\mathrm{fin}}(X)=\\{Y\\subseteq X:Y\\text{ 为有限集}\\},\\qquad\nX^{&lt;\\omega}=\\bigcup_{n\\in\\mathbb N}X^n,\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathbb N=\\{0,1,2,\\ldots\\},\\qquad\n\\mathcal P_{\\mathrm{fin}}(X)=\\{Y\\subseteq X:Y\\text{ 为有限集}\\},\\qquad\nX^{&lt;\\omega}=\\bigcup_{n\\in\\mathbb N}X^n,\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>并令 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{Prop}=\\{p_i:i\\in\\mathbb N\\}\">\\(\\mathsf{Prop}=\\{p_i:i\\in\\mathbb N\\}\\)</span>。原始公式构造子的类型为</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{atom}:\\mathsf{Prop}\\to\\mathsf{Frm}_{622},\\quad\n\\bot\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{622},\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{atom}:\\mathsf{Prop}\\to\\mathsf{Frm}_{622},\\quad\n\\bot\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{622},\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{neg},\\operatorname{Fut},\\operatorname{Past}:\\mathsf{Frm}_{622}\\to\\mathsf{Frm}_{622},\\qquad\n\\operatorname{imp}:\\mathsf{Frm}_{622}^{2}\\to\\mathsf{Frm}_{622}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{neg},\\operatorname{Fut},\\operatorname{Past}:\\mathsf{Frm}_{622}\\to\\mathsf{Frm}_{622},\\qquad\n\\operatorname{imp}:\\mathsf{Frm}_{622}^{2}\\to\\mathsf{Frm}_{622}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>显示记号：</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\neg A=\\operatorname{neg}(A),\\quad A\\to B=\\operatorname{imp}(A,B),\\quad\nFA=\\operatorname{Fut}(A),\\quad PA=\\operatorname{Past}(A).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\neg A=\\operatorname{neg}(A),\\quad A\\to B=\\operatorname{imp}(A,B),\\quad\nFA=\\operatorname{Fut}(A),\\quad PA=\\operatorname{Past}(A).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>派生记号：</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\top=(\\bot\\to\\bot),\\quad A\\land B=\\neg(A\\to\\neg B),\\quad GA=\\neg F\\neg A,\\quad HA=\\neg P\\neg A.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\top=(\\bot\\to\\bot),\\quad A\\land B=\\neg(A\\to\\neg B),\\quad GA=\\neg F\\neg A,\\quad HA=\\neg P\\neg A.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>本系统没有绑定构造子。</p>\n<h1 id=\"2.-公式\">2. 公式</h1>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{Frm}_{622}\">\\(\\mathsf{Frm}_{622}\\)</span> 是满足下列条件的最小集合：</p>\n<ol>\n<li>若 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"p\\in\\mathsf{Prop}\">\\(p\\in\\mathsf{Prop}\\)</span>，则 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{atom}(p)\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{622}\">\\(\\operatorname{atom}(p)\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{622}\\)</span>。</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\bot\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{622}\">\\(\\bot\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{622}\\)</span>。</li>\n<li>若 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{622}\">\\(A\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{622}\\)</span>，则 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\neg A\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{622}\">\\(\\neg A\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{622}\\)</span>。</li>\n<li>若 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A,B\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{622}\">\\(A,B\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{622}\\)</span>，则 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A\\to B\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{622}\">\\(A\\to B\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{622}\\)</span>。</li>\n<li>若 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{622}\">\\(A\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{622}\\)</span>，则 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"FA\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{622}\">\\(FA\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{622}\\)</span>。</li>\n<li>若 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{622}\">\\(A\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{622}\\)</span>，则 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"PA\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{622}\">\\(PA\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{622}\\)</span>。</li>\n</ol>\n<h1 id=\"3.-自由变元\">3. 自由变元</h1>\n<p>定义 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{FV}_{622}:\\mathsf{Frm}_{622}\\to\\mathcal P(\\mathsf{Prop})\">\\(\\operatorname{FV}_{622}:\\mathsf{Frm}_{622}\\to\\mathcal P(\\mathsf{Prop})\\)</span>：</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{FV}_{622}(\\operatorname{atom}(p))=\\{p\\},\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{FV}_{622}(\\operatorname{atom}(p))=\\{p\\},\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{FV}_{622}(\\bot)=\\varnothing,\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{FV}_{622}(\\bot)=\\varnothing,\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{FV}_{622}(\\neg A)=\\operatorname{FV}_{622}(A),\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{FV}_{622}(\\neg A)=\\operatorname{FV}_{622}(A),\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{FV}_{622}(A\\to B)=\\operatorname{FV}_{622}(A)\\cup\\operatorname{FV}_{622}(B),\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{FV}_{622}(A\\to B)=\\operatorname{FV}_{622}(A)\\cup\\operatorname{FV}_{622}(B),\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{FV}_{622}(FA)=\\operatorname{FV}_{622}(A),\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{FV}_{622}(FA)=\\operatorname{FV}_{622}(A),\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{FV}_{622}(PA)=\\operatorname{FV}_{622}(A).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{FV}_{622}(PA)=\\operatorname{FV}_{622}(A).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>定义 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{BV}_{622}:\\mathsf{Frm}_{622}\\to\\mathcal P(\\mathsf{Prop})\">\\(\\operatorname{BV}_{622}:\\mathsf{Frm}_{622}\\to\\mathcal P(\\mathsf{Prop})\\)</span> 为</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{BV}_{622}(A)=\\varnothing.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{BV}_{622}(A)=\\varnothing.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h1 id=\"4.-命题替换\">4. 命题替换</h1>\n<p>令</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{supp}(\\sigma)=\\{p\\in\\mathsf{Prop}:\\sigma(p)\\ne\\operatorname{atom}(p)\\},\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{supp}(\\sigma)=\\{p\\in\\mathsf{Prop}:\\sigma(p)\\ne\\operatorname{atom}(p)\\},\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{Subst}_{622}\n=\n\\{\\sigma\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{622}^{\\mathsf{Prop}}:\n\\operatorname{supp}(\\sigma)\\in\\mathcal P_{\\mathrm{fin}}(\\mathsf{Prop})\\}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathsf{Subst}_{622}\n=\n\\{\\sigma\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{622}^{\\mathsf{Prop}}:\n\\operatorname{supp}(\\sigma)\\in\\mathcal P_{\\mathrm{fin}}(\\mathsf{Prop})\\}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>定义</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{Sub}_{622}:\\mathsf{Frm}_{622}\\times\\mathsf{Subst}_{622}\\to\\mathsf{Frm}_{622},\n\\qquad\n\\operatorname{Sub}_{622}(A,\\sigma)=\\widehat\\sigma(A),\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{Sub}_{622}:\\mathsf{Frm}_{622}\\times\\mathsf{Subst}_{622}\\to\\mathsf{Frm}_{622},\n\\qquad\n\\operatorname{Sub}_{622}(A,\\sigma)=\\widehat\\sigma(A),\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>其中扩张 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\widehat\\sigma\">\\(\\widehat\\sigma\\)</span> 递归满足：</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\widehat\\sigma(\\operatorname{atom}(p))=\\sigma(p),\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\widehat\\sigma(\\operatorname{atom}(p))=\\sigma(p),\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\widehat\\sigma(\\bot)=\\bot,\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\widehat\\sigma(\\bot)=\\bot,\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\widehat\\sigma(\\neg A)=\\neg\\widehat\\sigma(A),\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\widehat\\sigma(\\neg A)=\\neg\\widehat\\sigma(A),\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\widehat\\sigma(A\\to B)=\\widehat\\sigma(A)\\to\\widehat\\sigma(B),\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\widehat\\sigma(A\\to B)=\\widehat\\sigma(A)\\to\\widehat\\sigma(B),\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\widehat\\sigma(FA)=F\\widehat\\sigma(A),\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\widehat\\sigma(FA)=F\\widehat\\sigma(A),\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\widehat\\sigma(PA)=P\\widehat\\sigma(A).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\widehat\\sigma(PA)=P\\widehat\\sigma(A).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>定义 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A\\equiv_{\\alpha,622}B\">\\(A\\equiv_{\\alpha,622}B\\)</span> 当且仅当 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A=B\">\\(A=B\\)</span>。</p>\n<h1 id=\"5.-公理集合\">5. 公理集合</h1>\n<p>命题公理族：</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{Ax}_{\\to,1}^{622}=\\{A\\to(B\\to A):A,B\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{622}\\},\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathsf{Ax}_{\\to,1}^{622}=\\{A\\to(B\\to A):A,B\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{622}\\},\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{Ax}_{\\to,2}^{622}=\\{(A\\to(B\\to C))\\to((A\\to B)\\to(A\\to C)):A,B,C\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{622}\\},\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathsf{Ax}_{\\to,2}^{622}=\\{(A\\to(B\\to C))\\to((A\\to B)\\to(A\\to C)):A,B,C\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{622}\\},\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{Ax}_{\\to,3}^{622}=\\{((\\neg A\\to\\neg B)\\to(B\\to A)):A,B\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{622}\\}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathsf{Ax}_{\\to,3}^{622}=\\{((\\neg A\\to\\neg B)\\to(B\\to A)):A,B\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{622}\\}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>未来必然与过去必然的正规公理：</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{Ax}_{G K}^{622}=\\{G(A\\to B)\\to(GA\\to GB):A,B\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{622}\\},\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathsf{Ax}_{G K}^{622}=\\{G(A\\to B)\\to(GA\\to GB):A,B\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{622}\\},\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{Ax}_{H K}^{622}=\\{H(A\\to B)\\to(HA\\to HB):A,B\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{622}\\}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathsf{Ax}_{H K}^{622}=\\{H(A\\to B)\\to(HA\\to HB):A,B\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{622}\\}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>Prior 回溯连接公理：</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{Ax}_{FP}^{622}=\\{A\\to GP A:A\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{622}\\},\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathsf{Ax}_{FP}^{622}=\\{A\\to GP A:A\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{622}\\},\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{Ax}_{PF}^{622}=\\{A\\to HF A:A\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{622}\\}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathsf{Ax}_{PF}^{622}=\\{A\\to HF A:A\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{622}\\}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>总公理集合：</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{Ax}_{622}\n=\n\\mathsf{Ax}_{\\to,1}^{622}\\cup\\mathsf{Ax}_{\\to,2}^{622}\\cup\\mathsf{Ax}_{\\to,3}^{622}\n\\cup\\mathsf{Ax}_{G K}^{622}\\cup\\mathsf{Ax}_{H K}^{622}\\cup\\mathsf{Ax}_{FP}^{622}\\cup\\mathsf{Ax}_{PF}^{622}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathsf{Ax}_{622}\n=\n\\mathsf{Ax}_{\\to,1}^{622}\\cup\\mathsf{Ax}_{\\to,2}^{622}\\cup\\mathsf{Ax}_{\\to,3}^{622}\n\\cup\\mathsf{Ax}_{G K}^{622}\\cup\\mathsf{Ax}_{H K}^{622}\\cup\\mathsf{Ax}_{FP}^{622}\\cup\\mathsf{Ax}_{PF}^{622}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h1 id=\"6.-推理规则关系\">6. 推理规则关系</h1>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{Rule}_{MP}^{622}=\\{((A,A\\to B),B):A,B\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{622}\\},\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathsf{Rule}_{MP}^{622}=\\{((A,A\\to B),B):A,B\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{622}\\},\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{Rule}_{NecF}^{622}=\\{((A),GA):A\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{622}\\},\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathsf{Rule}_{NecF}^{622}=\\{((A),GA):A\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{622}\\},\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{Rule}_{NecP}^{622}=\\{((A),HA):A\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{622}\\}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathsf{Rule}_{NecP}^{622}=\\{((A),HA):A\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{622}\\}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>令 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{Rule}_{622}=\\mathsf{Rule}_{MP}^{622}\\cup\\mathsf{Rule}_{NecF}^{622}\\cup\\mathsf{Rule}_{NecP}^{622}\">\\(\\mathsf{Rule}_{622}=\\mathsf{Rule}_{MP}^{622}\\cup\\mathsf{Rule}_{NecF}^{622}\\cup\\mathsf{Rule}_{NecP}^{622}\\)</span>。</p>\n<p>各规则关系均视为 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{Frm}_{622}^{&lt;\\omega}\\times\\mathsf{Frm}_{622}\">\\(\\mathsf{Frm}_{622}^{&lt;\\omega}\\times\\mathsf{Frm}_{622}\\)</span> 的子集；其显示式为</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\frac{A\\qquad A\\to B}{B}\\ (MP),\\qquad\n\\frac{A}{GA}\\ (NecF),\\qquad\n\\frac{A}{HA}\\ (NecP).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\frac{A\\qquad A\\to B}{B}\\ (MP),\\qquad\n\\frac{A}{GA}\\ (NecF),\\qquad\n\\frac{A}{HA}\\ (NecP).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h1 id=\"7.-证明对象\">7. 证明对象</h1>\n<p>令 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Gamma\\subseteq\\mathsf{Frm}_{622}\">\\(\\Gamma\\subseteq\\mathsf{Frm}_{622}\\)</span>。一个 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Gamma\">\\(\\Gamma\\)</span>-证明是序列</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\pi=((\\Delta_i,A_i))_{i&lt;m},\\qquad\nm\\in\\mathbb N\\setminus\\{0\\},\\quad\n(\\Delta_i,A_i)\\in\\mathcal P_{\\mathrm{fin}}(\\mathsf{Frm}_{622})\\times\\mathsf{Frm}_{622},\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\pi=((\\Delta_i,A_i))_{i&lt;m},\\qquad\nm\\in\\mathbb N\\setminus\\{0\\},\\quad\n(\\Delta_i,A_i)\\in\\mathcal P_{\\mathrm{fin}}(\\mathsf{Frm}_{622})\\times\\mathsf{Frm}_{622},\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>且每个 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"i&lt;m\">\\(i&lt;m\\)</span> 恰由下列一种许可证说明：</p>\n<ol>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A_i\\in\\Gamma\">\\(A_i\\in\\Gamma\\)</span> 且 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Delta_i=\\{A_i\\}\">\\(\\Delta_i=\\{A_i\\}\\)</span>。</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A_i\\in\\mathsf{Ax}_{622}\">\\(A_i\\in\\mathsf{Ax}_{622}\\)</span> 且 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Delta_i=\\varnothing\">\\(\\Delta_i=\\varnothing\\)</span>。</li>\n<li>存在 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"j,k&lt;i\">\\(j,k&lt;i\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A_k=A_j\\to A_i\">\\(A_k=A_j\\to A_i\\)</span>，且 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Delta_i=\\Delta_j\\cup\\Delta_k\">\\(\\Delta_i=\\Delta_j\\cup\\Delta_k\\)</span>。</li>\n<li>存在 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"j&lt;i\">\\(j&lt;i\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A_i=GA_j\">\\(A_i=GA_j\\)</span>，且 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Delta_j=\\Delta_i=\\varnothing\">\\(\\Delta_j=\\Delta_i=\\varnothing\\)</span>。</li>\n<li>存在 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"j&lt;i\">\\(j&lt;i\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A_i=HA_j\">\\(A_i=HA_j\\)</span>，且 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Delta_j=\\Delta_i=\\varnothing\">\\(\\Delta_j=\\Delta_i=\\varnothing\\)</span>。</li>\n</ol>\n<p>令 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{Proof}_{622}(\\Gamma)\">\\(\\mathsf{Proof}_{622}(\\Gamma)\\)</span> 为所有满足上述条件的序列的集合，并定义</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{last}_{622}(\\pi)=A_{m-1},\\qquad\n\\operatorname{dep}_{622}(\\pi)=\\Delta_{m-1}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{last}_{622}(\\pi)=A_{m-1},\\qquad\n\\operatorname{dep}_{622}(\\pi)=\\Delta_{m-1}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h1 id=\"8.-可证性\">8. 可证性</h1>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\Gamma\\vdash_{622}A\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\Gamma\\vdash_{622}A\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>当且仅当存在 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\pi\\in\\mathsf{Proof}_{622}(\\Gamma)\">\\(\\pi\\in\\mathsf{Proof}_{622}(\\Gamma)\\)</span>，使得</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{last}_{622}(\\pi)=A,\\qquad\n\\operatorname{dep}_{622}(\\pi)\\subseteq\\Gamma.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{last}_{622}(\\pi)=A,\\qquad\n\\operatorname{dep}_{622}(\\pi)\\subseteq\\Gamma.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{Thm}_{622}=\\{A\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{622}:\\varnothing\\vdash_{622}A\\}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathsf{Thm}_{622}=\\{A\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{622}:\\varnothing\\vdash_{622}A\\}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>有限证书关系为</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{Cert}_{622}\n=\n\\{(\\Gamma,A,\\pi):\\Gamma\\subseteq\\mathsf{Frm}_{622},\n\\pi\\in\\mathsf{Proof}_{622}(\\Gamma),\n\\operatorname{last}_{622}(\\pi)=A,\n\\operatorname{dep}_{622}(\\pi)\\subseteq\\Gamma\\}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathsf{Cert}_{622}\n=\n\\{(\\Gamma,A,\\pi):\\Gamma\\subseteq\\mathsf{Frm}_{622},\n\\pi\\in\\mathsf{Proof}_{622}(\\Gamma),\n\\operatorname{last}_{622}(\\pi)=A,\n\\operatorname{dep}_{622}(\\pi)\\subseteq\\Gamma\\}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h1 id=\"9.-Prior-时态语义\">9. Prior 时态语义</h1>\n<p>Prior 时态模型类定义为</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{PriorMod}_{622}\n=\n\\{(T,&lt;,V):T\\ne\\varnothing,\\ &lt;\\ \\subseteq T\\times T,\\ V:\\mathsf{Prop}\\to\\mathcal P(T)\\}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathsf{PriorMod}_{622}\n=\n\\{(T,&lt;,V):T\\ne\\varnothing,\\ &lt;\\ \\subseteq T\\times T,\\ V:\\mathsf{Prop}\\to\\mathcal P(T)\\}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>以下固定任意 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal M=(T,&lt;,V)\\in\\mathsf{PriorMod}_{622}\">\\(\\mathcal M=(T,&lt;,V)\\in\\mathsf{PriorMod}_{622}\\)</span>。</p>\n<p>对每个 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal M\\in\\mathsf{PriorMod}_{622}\">\\(\\mathcal M\\in\\mathsf{PriorMod}_{622}\\)</span>，解释函数</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\llbracket-\\rrbracket_{622}^{\\mathcal M}:\\mathsf{Frm}_{622}\\to\\mathcal P(T)\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\llbracket-\\rrbracket_{622}^{\\mathcal M}:\\mathsf{Frm}_{622}\\to\\mathcal P(T)\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>递归定义为</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\llbracket\\operatorname{atom}(p)\\rrbracket_{622}^{\\mathcal M}=V(p),\\quad\n\\llbracket\\bot\\rrbracket_{622}^{\\mathcal M}=\\varnothing,\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\llbracket\\operatorname{atom}(p)\\rrbracket_{622}^{\\mathcal M}=V(p),\\quad\n\\llbracket\\bot\\rrbracket_{622}^{\\mathcal M}=\\varnothing,\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\llbracket\\neg A\\rrbracket_{622}^{\\mathcal M}=T\\setminus\\llbracket A\\rrbracket_{622}^{\\mathcal M},\\quad\n\\llbracket A\\to B\\rrbracket_{622}^{\\mathcal M}=(T\\setminus\\llbracket A\\rrbracket_{622}^{\\mathcal M})\\cup\\llbracket B\\rrbracket_{622}^{\\mathcal M},\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\llbracket\\neg A\\rrbracket_{622}^{\\mathcal M}=T\\setminus\\llbracket A\\rrbracket_{622}^{\\mathcal M},\\quad\n\\llbracket A\\to B\\rrbracket_{622}^{\\mathcal M}=(T\\setminus\\llbracket A\\rrbracket_{622}^{\\mathcal M})\\cup\\llbracket B\\rrbracket_{622}^{\\mathcal M},\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\llbracket FA\\rrbracket_{622}^{\\mathcal M}\n=\n\\{t\\in T:\\exists u\\in T\\ (t&lt;u\\land u\\in\\llbracket A\\rrbracket_{622}^{\\mathcal M})\\},\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\llbracket FA\\rrbracket_{622}^{\\mathcal M}\n=\n\\{t\\in T:\\exists u\\in T\\ (t&lt;u\\land u\\in\\llbracket A\\rrbracket_{622}^{\\mathcal M})\\},\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\llbracket PA\\rrbracket_{622}^{\\mathcal M}\n=\n\\{t\\in T:\\exists u\\in T\\ (u&lt;t\\land u\\in\\llbracket A\\rrbracket_{622}^{\\mathcal M})\\},\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\llbracket PA\\rrbracket_{622}^{\\mathcal M}\n=\n\\{t\\in T:\\exists u\\in T\\ (u&lt;t\\land u\\in\\llbracket A\\rrbracket_{622}^{\\mathcal M})\\},\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\llbracket GA\\rrbracket_{622}^{\\mathcal M}\n=\n\\{t\\in T:\\forall u\\in T\\ (t&lt;u\\Rightarrow u\\in\\llbracket A\\rrbracket_{622}^{\\mathcal M})\\},\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\llbracket GA\\rrbracket_{622}^{\\mathcal M}\n=\n\\{t\\in T:\\forall u\\in T\\ (t&lt;u\\Rightarrow u\\in\\llbracket A\\rrbracket_{622}^{\\mathcal M})\\},\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\llbracket HA\\rrbracket_{622}^{\\mathcal M}\n=\n\\{t\\in T:\\forall u\\in T\\ (u&lt;t\\Rightarrow u\\in\\llbracket A\\rrbracket_{622}^{\\mathcal M})\\}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\llbracket HA\\rrbracket_{622}^{\\mathcal M}\n=\n\\{t\\in T:\\forall u\\in T\\ (u&lt;t\\Rightarrow u\\in\\llbracket A\\rrbracket_{622}^{\\mathcal M})\\}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>满足关系定义为</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal M,t\\Vdash_{622}A\n\\Longleftrightarrow\nt\\in\\llbracket A\\rrbracket_{622}^{\\mathcal M}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathcal M,t\\Vdash_{622}A\n\\Longleftrightarrow\nt\\in\\llbracket A\\rrbracket_{622}^{\\mathcal M}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>语义后承定义为</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\Gamma\\models_{622}A\n\\Longleftrightarrow\n\\forall \\mathcal M=(T,&lt;,V)\\in\\mathsf{PriorMod}_{622}\\ \\forall t\\in T\\\n((\\forall B\\in\\Gamma\\ \\mathcal M,t\\Vdash_{622}B)\\Rightarrow\\mathcal M,t\\Vdash_{622}A).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\Gamma\\models_{622}A\n\\Longleftrightarrow\n\\forall \\mathcal M=(T,&lt;,V)\\in\\mathsf{PriorMod}_{622}\\ \\forall t\\in T\\\n((\\forall B\\in\\Gamma\\ \\mathcal M,t\\Vdash_{622}B)\\Rightarrow\\mathcal M,t\\Vdash_{622}A).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h1 id=\"10.-目标区分\">10. 目标区分</h1>\n<p>Prior 时态逻辑的目标差异是同时含有未来可能 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"F\">\\(F\\)</span> 与过去可能 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"P\">\\(P\\)</span>，并通过 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{Ax}_{FP}^{622}\">\\(\\mathsf{Ax}_{FP}^{622}\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{Ax}_{PF}^{622}\">\\(\\mathsf{Ax}_{PF}^{622}\\)</span> 连接二者；第 9 节在同一时间关系 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"&lt;\">\\(&lt;\\)</span> 上解释未来、过去、一直未来和一直过去。</p>\n<h1 id=\"11.-整个形式系统\">11. 整个形式系统</h1>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal{Prior}_{622}\n=\n(\\mathsf{Prop},\\mathsf{Frm}_{622},\\operatorname{FV}_{622},\\operatorname{BV}_{622},\n\\mathsf{Subst}_{622},\\operatorname{Sub}_{622},\\equiv_{\\alpha,622},\n\\mathsf{Ax}_{622},\\mathsf{Rule}_{622},\\mathsf{Proof}_{622},\\operatorname{last}_{622},\n\\mathsf{Cert}_{622},\\vdash_{622},\\mathsf{Thm}_{622},\n\\mathsf{PriorMod}_{622},\\llbracket-\\rrbracket_{622},\\Vdash_{622},\\models_{622}).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathcal{Prior}_{622}\n=\n(\\mathsf{Prop},\\mathsf{Frm}_{622},\\operatorname{FV}_{622},\\operatorname{BV}_{622},\n\\mathsf{Subst}_{622},\\operatorname{Sub}_{622},\\equiv_{\\alpha,622},\n\\mathsf{Ax}_{622},\\mathsf{Rule}_{622},\\mathsf{Proof}_{622},\\operatorname{last}_{622},\n\\mathsf{Cert}_{622},\\vdash_{622},\\mathsf{Thm}_{622},\n\\mathsf{PriorMod}_{622},\\llbracket-\\rrbracket_{622},\\Vdash_{622},\\models_{622}).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>该系统由 Prior 时态句法、公理、规则、证明关系以及时间点模型语义共同组成。</p>\n<p>本条目不在此处断言可靠性、完备性、时间结构表示定理或模型检查算法。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"1.-符号表","text":"1. 符号表","level":1},{"id":"2.-公式","text":"2. 公式","level":1},{"id":"3.-自由变元","text":"3. 自由变元","level":1},{"id":"4.-命题替换","text":"4. 命题替换","level":1},{"id":"5.-公理集合","text":"5. 公理集合","level":1},{"id":"6.-推理规则关系","text":"6. 推理规则关系","level":1},{"id":"7.-证明对象","text":"7. 证明对象","level":1},{"id":"8.-可证性","text":"8. 可证性","level":1},{"id":"9.-Prior-时态语义","text":"9. Prior 时态语义","level":1},{"id":"10.-目标区分","text":"10. 目标区分","level":1},{"id":"11.-整个形式系统","text":"11. 整个形式系统","level":1}],"links":[],"math":[{"tex":"\\mathbb N=\\{0,1,2,\\ldots\\},\\qquad\n\\mathcal P_{\\mathrm{fin}}(X)=\\{Y\\subseteq X:Y\\text{ 为有限集}\\},\\qquad\nX^{<\\omega}=\\bigcup_{n\\in\\mathbb N}X^n,","display":true},{"tex":"\\mathsf{Prop}=\\{p_i:i\\in\\mathbb N\\}","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{atom}:\\mathsf{Prop}\\to\\mathsf{Frm}_{622},\\quad\n\\bot\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{622},","display":true},{"tex":"\\operatorname{neg},\\operatorname{Fut},\\operatorname{Past}:\\mathsf{Frm}_{622}\\to\\mathsf{Frm}_{622},\\qquad\n\\operatorname{imp}:\\mathsf{Frm}_{622}^{2}\\to\\mathsf{Frm}_{622}.","display":true},{"tex":"\\neg A=\\operatorname{neg}(A),\\quad A\\to B=\\operatorname{imp}(A,B),\\quad\nFA=\\operatorname{Fut}(A),\\quad PA=\\operatorname{Past}(A).","display":true},{"tex":"\\top=(\\bot\\to\\bot),\\quad A\\land B=\\neg(A\\to\\neg B),\\quad GA=\\neg F\\neg A,\\quad HA=\\neg P\\neg A.","display":true},{"tex":"\\mathsf{Frm}_{622}","display":false},{"tex":"p\\in\\mathsf{Prop}","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{atom}(p)\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{622}","display":false},{"tex":"\\bot\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{622}","display":false},{"tex":"A\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{622}","display":false},{"tex":"\\neg A\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{622}","display":false},{"tex":"A,B\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{622}","display":false},{"tex":"A\\to B\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{622}","display":false},{"tex":"A\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{622}","display":false},{"tex":"FA\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{622}","display":false},{"tex":"A\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{622}","display":false},{"tex":"PA\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{622}","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{FV}_{622}:\\mathsf{Frm}_{622}\\to\\mathcal P(\\mathsf{Prop})","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{FV}_{622}(\\operatorname{atom}(p))=\\{p\\},","display":true},{"tex":"\\operatorname{FV}_{622}(\\bot)=\\varnothing,","display":true},{"tex":"\\operatorname{FV}_{622}(\\neg A)=\\operatorname{FV}_{622}(A),","display":true},{"tex":"\\operatorname{FV}_{622}(A\\to B)=\\operatorname{FV}_{622}(A)\\cup\\operatorname{FV}_{622}(B),","display":true},{"tex":"\\operatorname{FV}_{622}(FA)=\\operatorname{FV}_{622}(A),","display":true},{"tex":"\\operatorname{FV}_{622}(PA)=\\operatorname{FV}_{622}(A).","display":true},{"tex":"\\operatorname{BV}_{622}:\\mathsf{Frm}_{622}\\to\\mathcal P(\\mathsf{Prop})","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{BV}_{622}(A)=\\varnothing.","display":true},{"tex":"\